			],
			"Message": "build(Land): Restructure TypeScript project references and watch options\n\nReorganize the root tsconfig.json and jsconfig.json to align project\nreference order with dependency topology and extend file watching\nexclusions.\n\n- Remove redundant compilerOptions from tsconfig.json (emitDeclarationOnly,\n  jsx, noEmit, outDir, rootDir) since they are inherited from\n  @playform/build/tsconfig via extends.\n- Reorder project references to [Sky, Worker, Output, Wind] reflecting the\n  actual dependency flow from UI components through workers to bundled output.\n- Add Target/ directory to watchOptions.excludeDirectories to prevent\n  watching generated build artifacts.\n- Apply consistent multi-line array formatting across both config files.\n- Simplify Markdown formatter by removing unnecessary parentheses in\n  SingleText condition.\n\nThis reduces configuration drift and improves incremental build performance\nby excluding the Target/ output directory from file watching.",
			"SHA": "ae0113e917c68cd5d6d4ee211447c7cb71ff2289"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-09T17:20:07Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				154,
				31
			],
			"Message": "Refactor shell scripts to improve output redirection\n\n- Updated multiple shell scripts to change output redirection from `>/dev/null` to `> /dev/null` for consistency and readability.\n- Ensured that error redirection remains unchanged, preserving the original functionality.\n- Scripts modified include: Repository.sh, AbsorbGitDirs.sh, CommitGraph.sh, GarbageCollect.sh, PruneRemote.sh, Sync.sh, Save.sh, CleanGenerated.sh, GenerateRouteManifest.sh, PostHogCapture.sh, ProfileMarker.sh, ResolveIdentity.sh, ResolveProductConfig.sh, SignBundle.sh, TierEnvironment.sh, TelemetryTreeShake.sh, Dependency.sh, and Documentation.sh.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "ec95c4d01a7d2bc32ab8cc9c109a34303cba8823"
		},
		{
